# Never commit API keys, service-account credentials, the live item bank, or any file
# carrying question / reference-answer / rubric / model-output text.
# These entries are load-bearing for the redaction policy described in REPLICATION.md.

# credentials
.groq_key
.firestore_key.json
*.key
*_key
*.json
.env
.env.*

# live assessment content (questions, reference answers, rubrics)
items.csv

# raw model outputs (contain disclosed solutions)
results/raw_results.csv
results_*/
human_codes.csv
human_coding_sheet.csv

# blinded coding sheets: these carry question, reference_answer and model_output
# columns as issued to the adjudicators. The codes they returned are published in
# adjudication/ with those columns stripped; the sheets themselves are not.
*_sheet.csv
adjudication_*_sheet.csv
reliability_coder2_sheet.csv

# published deliberately, listed here so the exclusions above are not read too broadly:
#   results/raw_results_redacted.csv   per-trial outcomes, output column stripped
#   adjudication/*.csv                 adjudicator codes plus sampling keys
#   results/*.txt                      precomputed analysis reports

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
